B.a0T=new A.b6("prx_advanced_healing","Advanced Healing",B.aZ,3,"[Action]: Apply these effects in any combination up to X times:\n\u2022 Restore 1 Health (max 3).\n\u2022 Restore 1 Skill peg (max 1).\n\u2022 Remove a status counter.")
B.a1j=new A.b6("prx_levitation","Levitation",B.aZ,3,"Passive: Use during a Move to ignore terrain or characters (including ignoring attacks of opportunity) of up to X inches in height.")
B.a1m=new A.b6("prx_alter_appearance","Alter Appearance",B.aZ,3,"[Action]: Temporarily distort your features to resemble any other character of the same size. Other characters in play will treat you as that character type for all purposes, and will give permission to your character where required (e.g. to move through them or take an item). Characters with a higher rank than the caster ignore these effects.\nPlace X Reminder counters on your character board. Remove one counter each Assessment Phase. Effects last until the last counter is removed.")
B.a1k=new A.b6("prx_phasing","Phasing",B.aZ,4,"[Action] [Action]: Make a Move of up to X squares, freely moving through walls and terrain and ignoring attacks of opportunity. Must end the Move in an empty square.")
B.a1_=new A.b6("prx_foresight","Foresight",B.aZ,4,"[Action]: Look at the top X cards of the Event Deck. Place them back in any order, but turn them 90\xb0 to mark which ones you have seen.\nWhen any of these rotated cards is resolved, you may spend a Magic peg to re-roll any randomised effect such as an Entry Point or chosen Adventurer.")
B.a1w=new A.b6("prx_rearrange_cells","Rearrange Cells",B.aZ,5,"[Action]: Temporarily mutate your body into that of a beast.\nIncrease the following statistics by a total of X+2 in any combination:\n\u2022 [Unarmed Combat] (max 4)\n\u2022 [Armour] (max 3)\n\u2022 [Fast] (max 2)\nInstead of increasing a statistic, you may add any of [Bludgeoning] / [Sharp] / [Quickstrike] / [Entangling] / [Vicious] to your attacks.\nIncrease your size by 1, or increase it by 2 and become [Terrifying] if X is 3 or more.\nWhile mutated you cannot use any equipment, although you can still carry it.\nPlace X Reminder counters on your character board. Remove one counter each Assessment Phase. Effects last until the last counter is removed.")
B.b_=new A.F_(1,"vicarious")
B.a17=new A.b6("vic_bless","Bless",B.b_,1,"[Action]: Target gains X [Blessed] counters.")
B.a1t=new A.b6("vic_protect","Protect",B.b_,1,"[Action]: Target gains +X [Armour] until the end of the round.")
B.a1u=new A.b6("vic_calm","Calm",B.b_,1,"[Action]: Target removes a [Terrified] counter.")
B.a1d=new A.b6("vic_fortitude","Fortitude",B.b_,1,"[Action]: Target may ignore any status counters that would be applied until the end of the round.")
B.a1o=new A.b6("vic_deflection","Deflection",B.b_,1,"[Action]: Target increases their [Warded] value by X (max 1) until the end of the round.")
B.a1p=new A.b6("vic_clouded_minds","Clouded Minds",B.b_,1,"[Action]: Place X Reminder counters on eligible targets. If a target would act outside their turn (e.g. Attacks of Opportunity, Parry, Shield Block, Reaction Skills, etc) they must discard a counter instead of acting. The counters are removed in the Assessment Phase.")
B.a0W=new A.b6("vic_strengthen","Strengthen",B.b_,2,"[Effortless]: Target removes X [Fatigued] counters.")
B.a0I=new A.b6("vic_healing_hands","Healing Hands",B.b_,2,"[Action]: Target restores X Health (max 3).")
B.a1f=new A.b6("vic_nausea","Nausea",B.b_,2,"[Action]: Target is [Poisoned].")
B.a0J=new A.b6("vic_enchantment","Enchantment",B.b_,2,"[Action]: Target is Moved up to X squares following all normal movement rules.")
B.a1n=new A.b6("vic_illusion","Illusion",B.b_,2,"[Action]: Place an Illusion in any empty square in range and LoS of both the caster and a chosen enemy. The enemy is distracted (see Illusions).")
B.a1g=new A.b6("vic_malacyte_sensitivity","Malacyte Sensitivity",B.b_,3,"Passive: This character's Vicarious spells may target characters in short range without LoS.")
B.a13=new A.b6("vic_stun","Stun",B.b_,3,"[Action]: Target suffers X [Fatigued] counters.")
B.a1s=new A.b6("vic_blood_boil","Blood Boil",B.b_,3,"[Action]: Target suffers an attack with 1 die and [Piercing].")
B.a1e=new A.b6("vic_rouse","Rouse",B.b_,3,"[Action]: Target removes a [Stunned] counter.")
B.a1q=new A.b6("vic_remote_resistance","Remote Resistance",B.b_,4,"Passive: This character may resist any spells cast within short range of themselves, using their own pegs, regardless of the target.")
B.a1y=new A.b6("vic_advanced_illusion","Advanced Illusion",B.b_,4,"[Action]: Place up to X Illusions in empty squares in range and LoS. All enemies within range and LoS of both the caster and an Illusion are distracted (see Illusions). For resistance purposes, this spell is considered to be cast with one peg.\n[Effortless]: Move an Illusion as if it were a character, ignoring attacks of opportunity.")
B.a18=new A.b6("vic_advanced_enchantment","Advanced Enchantment",B.b_,5,"[Action]: Target takes up to X actions (max 3) under your control.")
B.b0=new A.F_(2,"elemental")
B.a0L=new A.b6("elm_telekinesis","Telekinesis",B.b0,1,"[Effortless]: Choose one:\n\u2022 Move a loose item, an item in a friendly character's inventory, or a random item inside an unlocked terrain piece (whichever one you draw first) up to X+2 squares. Traps drawn are triggered against a single target in contact with the terrain piece, if any, and then discarded. If the item reaches a friendly character place it in their inventory. If the item is a weapon and it reaches an enemy, treat it as having been thrown at them.\n\u2022 Spread a fire \u2013 choose a source of fire and add a [Burning] counter to any character or terrain piece within X+2 squares of it.")
B.a0S=new A.b6("elm_open_door","Open Door",B.b0,1,"[Effortless]: Open or close an unlocked door.\n[Action]: Lock or unlock a door or terrain piece.")
B.a1a=new A.b6("elm_focused_energy","Focused Energy",B.b0,1,"[Action]: Make a ranged attack with X dice, [Bludgeoning] and [Sharp].")
B.a1l=new A.b6("elm_extinguish","Extinguish",B.b0,1,"[Action]: Remove a [Burning] counter, Torch (even from another character's inventory) or Brazier.")
B.a1c=new A.b6("elm_detect","Detect",B.b0,1,"Passive: Use during a General Search action to take X additional items (max. 3) from the pouch. Traps are resolved immediately. Any other additional items are scattered from the caster.")
B.a0N=new A.b6("elm_refract","Refract",B.b0,1,"[Action]: Place or flip a Darkness or Light counter and add X Reminder counters. Remove one Reminder counter in each Assessment Phase. Once the last is removed, return the room to its previous state.")
B.a15=new A.b6("elm_push","Push",B.b0,2,"[Action]: Move an item, character, or portable terrain piece up to X squares directly away from you, with no attacks of opportunity. You must spend at least as many pegs as a character/object's size to move it. If a character is moved more squares than they have actions they are knocked prone.")
B.a10=new A.b6("elm_barricade","Barricade",B.b0,2,"[Action]: Create a barricade of your choice.\nAlternatively, mark up to X squares of a pit with Reminder counters. These squares are considered solid ground. When all squares of a pit are marked, remove it. If a pit is removed while a character is inside, they are defeated and Left for Dead.")
B.a1r=new A.b6("elm_advanced_detect","Advanced Detect",B.b0,2,"[Action]: Look inside a Searchable terrain piece that fills up to X squares. You may discard an additional Magic peg to remove one Trap found.")
B.a0M=new A.b6("elm_advanced_telekinesis","Advanced Telekinesis",B.b0,2,"[Action]: Choose one:\n\u2022 Move any terrain piece you could normally move up to X+2 squares. If it reaches a character, stop moving and treat it as a Knockback with X+2 dice.\n\u2022 Move an item in an enemy's inventory up to X+2 squares. They may spend a Skill peg to scatter the item instead. Otherwise, if the item reaches a friendly character place it in their inventory. If the item is a weapon and it reaches an enemy, treat it as having been thrown at them.")
B.a1x=new A.b6("elm_weaken_armour","Weaken Armour",B.b0,2,"[Action]: Reduce an enemy's [Armour] by X until the end of the round.")
B.a0P=new A.b6("elm_malacyte_perception","Malacyte Perception",B.b0,3,"Passive: This character's Elemental spells may target objects in short range without LoS.")
B.a12=new A.b6("elm_fireball","Fireball",B.b0,3,"[Action]: Requires a source of fire within range of the caster and the target. Make a ranged attack from the source of fire with X dice, [Blast] and [Burning].")
B.a0R=new A.b6("elm_torrent","Torrent",B.b0,3,"[Action]: All targets must be in short range and LoS of a source of water.\nChoose one:\n\u2022 Remove X [Burning] counters, torches or sconces.\n\u2022 Knock X characters prone.\n\u2022 Choose a character and roll X dice. Each hit scored [Fatigues] the target. If the character becomes [Stunned], any remaining hits are treated as an attack with [Piercing].")
B.a0U=new A.b6("elm_cocoon","Cocoon",B.b0,3,"[Action]: Gain the benefits of a Rest action, regardless of enemies in the room or in short range and LoS (enemies engaged with a Resting character will still prevent it as normal). Nearby characters may Rest as part of the spell \u2013 it affects up to X characters (including the caster) with a range of X squares.")
B.a11=new A.b6("elm_energy_burst","Energy Burst",B.b0,4,"[Action]: Move characters or portable terrain pieces with a total size up to X up to X squares directly away from you, with no attacks of opportunity. Characters are knocked prone.")
B.a1v=new A.b6("elm_rebuild","Rebuild",B.b0,4,"[Action][Action]: Choose a wall of up to X squares in length. Detach it and reconnect it anywhere else within short range. This cannot cause any room to become inaccessible from the rest of the gaming area.")
B.a0K=new A.b6("elm_portal","Portal",B.b0,5,"[Action]: Place a Portal in an empty square.")
